="00:30.452">gun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.692" end="00:32.367"><span begin="00:30.692" end="00:30.996">It's </span><span begin="00:30.996" end="00:31.284">so </span><span begin="00:31.284" end="00:31.876">depressing </span><span begin="00:32.070" end="00:32.367">how</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.367" end="00:35.021"><span begin="00:32.367" end="00:32.686">The </span><span begin="00:32.798" end="00:33.182">tear </span><span begin="00:33.182" end="00:33.510">ducts </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.757">in </span><span begin="00:33.757" end="00:34.030">my </span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:35.021">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.350" end="00:37.382"><span begin="00:35.350" end="00:35.758">Are </span><span begin="00:35.758" end="00:36.118">so </span><span begin="00:36.118" end="00:36.494">much </span><span begin="00:36.494" end="00:37.054">wetter </span><span begin="00:37.054" end="00:37.382">than</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.551" end="00:39.429"><span begin="00:37.551" end="00:37.838">The </span><span begin="00:37.838" end="00:38.166">space </span><span begin="00:38.166" end="00:38.710">between </span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:39.054">my </span><span begin="00:39.054" end="00:39.429">thighs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.612" end="00:41.278"><span begin="00:39.612" end="00:39.853">Oh </span><span begin="00:39.853" end="00:40.143">oh </span><span begin="00:40.143" end="00:40.462">oh </span><span begin="00:40.462" end="00:40.686">I </span><span begin="00:40.686" end="00:40.982">can't </span><span begin="00:40.982" end="00:41.278">help</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.278" end="00:42.734"><span begin="00:41.278" end="00:41.568">If </span><span begin="00:41.568" end="00:41.950">thinking </span><span begin="00:41.950" end="00:42.486">about </span><span begin="00:42.486" end="00:42.734">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.886" end="00:44.418"><span begin="00:42.886" end="00:43.390">Only </span><span begin="00:43.390" end="00:43.710">makes </span><span begin="00:43.710" end="00:43.982">me </span><span begin="00:43.982" end="00:44.418">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.418" end="00:47.197"><span begin="00:44.418" end="00:44.698">It </span><span begin="00:44.698" end="00:44.978">keeps </span><span begin="00:44.978" end="00:45.095">me </span><span begin="00:45.343" end="00:46.293">wet </span><span begin="00:46.837" end="00:47.029">you </span><span begin="00:47.029" end="00:47.197">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.197" end="00:49.149"><span begin="00:47.197" end="00:47.381">You </span><span begin="00:47.381" end="00:47.709">keep </span><span begin="00:47.709" end="00:47.940">me </span><span begin="00:47.940" end="00:49.149">wet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.414" end="00:53.109"><span begin="00:49.414" end="00:49.693">'Til </span><span begin="00:49.693" end="00:49.982">I </span><span begin="00:49.982" end="00:50.950">run </span><span begin="00:50.950" end="00:53.109">dry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.778" end="01:01.850"><span begin="01:00.778" end="01:00.906">It's </span><span begin="01:00.906" end="01:01.242">nights </span><span begin="01:01.242" end="01:01.570">like </span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:01.850">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.005" end="01:03.417"><span begin="01:02.005" end="01:02.282">That </span><span begin="01:02.282" end="01:02.530">remind </span><span begin="01:02.530" end="01:02.796">me </span><span begin="01:02.796" end="01:03.122">of </span><span begin="01:03.122" end="01:03.417">my</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.417" end="01:05.490"><span begin="01:03.417" end="01:03.882">Deepest </span><span begin="01:03.882" end="01:05.490">fantasy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.690" end="01:07.338"><span begin="01:05.690" end="01:05.986">Where </span><span begin="01:05.986" end="01:06.337">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.337" end="01:06.674">all </span><